abstract: >-
  An explicit Gaussian-integer 8-by-26 frame and a self-contained candidate
  proof of global phase retrieval, with exact symbolic verification and
  reproducible data. The claimed result is m_C(8) <= 26, not optimality.
  Local logical and arithmetic checks have passed; external independent
  expert review and formal verification have not been completed.
